# Fusion (src 51) PGN 126998 Configuration Information — STRING_LAU with UTF-8.
# Captured 2026-08-29 in response to an ISO Request. Evidence for canboat#864.
#
# Installation Description #2:
#   11 01 4d 61 74 73 c5 ab 72 61 20 46 c3 a6 6b c3 a9
#   len 0x11 = 17 = 2 header + 15 payload bytes, control byte 1, NO trailing NUL
#   c5 ab = U+016B "ū" — a character with no Latin-1 representation at all.
#
# This is the same field type and the same control byte as the B&G route name in
# samples/bandg-129285-latin1.raw, which is Latin-1 (e6 = "æ") and DOES carry a
# trailing NUL counted in the length. So STRING_LAU control 1 is not one encoding:
# it is whatever the sending device felt like, and the length convention varies too.
#
# The Airmar DST810 frame is included as a plain-ASCII control.
